            "support_status": "not_independently_verified",
            "quotation": "The PCE price index decreased 0.1 percent. Excluding food and energy, the PCE price index increased 0.1\npercent (table 9). Real DPI increased 0.3 percent in July and real PCE increased 0.2 percent; goods\nincreased 0.2 percent and services increased 0.2 percent (tables 5 and 7)."
          },
